#     --json`, which reads tiers.tsv;
#   * per-screensaver options come from the shipped options/*.tsv schema
#     files the engine validates against.
# The engine is driven through its public CLI only (docs/CLI-CONTRACT.md);
# $NCZ_SCREENSAVER_CLI points at a launcher under another name or path.
#
# Testing hooks:
#   --dump       : JSON dump of live settings + catalog, no window, no display.
#   --self-test  : Drive the live UI, assert GSettings, exit 0/1/2.
#   --gtk-smoke  : Build the window, list and options dialog off-screen and
#                  assert they came up; exits 0/1, needs a display.
